### ============================
### 销售管理测试
### ============================

### 登录
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "123456"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("token", response.body.data.token);
%}


### ============================
### 客户
### ============================

### 客户列表
GET http://localhost:8080/api/customers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### 新增客户
POST http://localhost:8080/api/customers
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "测试客户",
  "phone": "13900000000",
  "address": "测试地址"
}


### ============================
### 销售单
### ============================

### 创建销售单（PENDING，库存不变）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/sales/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "customerId": 1,
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": 1,
      "quantity": 5,
      "price": 299.00
    },
    {
      "productId": 2,
      "quantity": 10,
      "price": 89.00
    }
  ]
}

> {%
    client.global.set("salesOrderId", response.body.data.id);
%}


### 验证创建后库存不变
GET http://localhost:8080/api/inventory/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### 查询销售单列表
GET http://localhost:8080/api/sales/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### 查询销售单详情
GET http://localhost:8080/api/sales/orders/{{salesOrderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### 完成出库（库存扣减）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/sales/orders/{{salesOrderId}}/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### 验证库存减少
GET http://localhost:8080/api/inventory/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### 重复出库 → 400
POST http://localhost:8080/api/sales/orders/{{salesOrderId}}/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ============================
### 库存不足测试
### ============================

### 创建超量销售单
POST http://localhost:8080/api/sales/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "customerId": 1,
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": 1,
      "quantity": 99999,
      "price": 299
    }
  ]
}

> {%
    client.global.set("overOrderId", response.body.data.id);
%}


### 出库 → 40001 库存不足
POST http://localhost:8080/api/sales/orders/{{overOrderId}}/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
